{"words": [{"text": "أَلَمْ", "translation": "Did not"}, {"text": "تَرَ", "translation": "you see"}, {"text": "إِلَى", "translation": "[towards]"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَلَإِ", "translation": "the chiefs"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "بَنِىٓ", "translation": "(the) Children"}, {"text": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translation": "(of) Israel"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مُوسَىٰٓ", "translation": "Musa"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "they said"}, {"text": "لِنَبِىٍّۢ", "translation": "to a Prophet"}, {"text": "لَّهُمُ", "translation": "of theirs"}, {"text": "ٱبْعَثْ", "translation": "Appoint"}, {"text": "لَنَا", "translation": "for us"}, {"text": "مَلِكًۭا", "translation": "a king"}, {"text": "نُّقَـٰتِلْ", "translation": "we may fight"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "سَبِيلِ", "translation": "(the) way"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۖ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "هَلْ", "translation": "Would"}, {"text": "عَسَيْتُمْ", "translation": "you perhaps "}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كُتِبَ", "translation": "prescribed"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمُ", "translation": "upon you"}, {"text": "ٱلْقِتَالُ", "translation": "[the] fighting"}, {"text": "أَلَّا", "translation": "that not"}, {"text": "تُقَـٰتِلُوا۟ ۖ", "translation": "you fight"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And what"}, {"text": "لَنَآ", "translation": "for us"}, {"text": "أَلَّا", "translation": "that not"}, {"text": "نُقَـٰتِلَ", "translation": "we fight"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "سَبِيلِ", "translation": "(the) way"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَقَدْ", "translation": "while surely"}, {"text": "أُخْرِجْنَا", "translation": "we have been driven"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "دِيَـٰرِنَا", "translation": "our homes"}, {"text": "وَأَبْنَآئِنَا ۖ", "translation": "and our children"}, {"text": "فَلَمَّا", "translation": "Yet, when"}, {"text": "كُتِبَ", "translation": "was prescribed"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمُ", "translation": "upon them"}, {"text": "ٱلْقِتَالُ", "translation": "the fighting"}, {"text": "تَوَلَّوْا۟", "translation": "they turned away"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "قَلِيلًۭا", "translation": "a few"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُمْ ۗ", "translation": "among them"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "عَلِيمٌۢ", "translation": "(is) All-Knowing"}, {"text": "بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "of the wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "Have you not considered the assembly of the Children of Israel after [the time of] Moses when they said to a prophet of theirs, \"Send to us a king, and we will fight in the way of Allāh\"? He said, \"Would you perhaps refrain from fighting if battle was prescribed for you?\" They said, \"And why should we not fight in the cause of Allāh when we have been driven out from our homes and from our children?\" But when battle was prescribed for them, they turned away, except for a few of them. And Allāh is Knowing of the wrongdoers."}